# Transient state written by the claude-code-sdlc hooks. Never commit it:
# the pipeline commits after every slice, so an untracked file under .claude/
# would eventually be swept into someone's commit.
.claude/tmp/

# Per-feature debugger diagnostic scratch (FR-8.8) — transient, per-invocation
# hypothesis/result logs, never curated project knowledge like
# .claude/instincts.md, which stays tracked.
.claude/debug/

# Per-worktree pipeline session state (PRD §15 FR-1) — live local state that
# never merges between branches. Each worktree keeps its own copy on disk.
.claude/scratchpad.md

.DS_Store
node_modules/
